 * All timestamps are handled as ISO 8601 strings. If a product already exists
 * for the same seller and title, an error is thrown.
 *
 * @param props - Function arguments
 * @param props.administrator - Authenticated administrator payload (must be
 *   active)
 * @param props.body - Product creation details (category_id, seller_id, title,
 *   status, and optional fields)
 * @returns The created product entity with all fields, normalized and
 *   conformant to API structure.
