 * fields, generates a new UUID, assigns server timestamps, and ensures that the
 * requester is the authenticated customer.
 *
 * @param props - Request properties
 * @param props.customer - The authenticated customer payload (must match
 *   body.requester_id)
 * @param props.body - Ticket creation data (subject, body, priority, category,
 *   optional assignee)
 * @returns The newly created support ticket, including all fields (normalized,
 *   with UUID and ISO date-times)
