 * @param props - Request properties
 * @param props.customer - Authenticated customer making the request
 * @param props.cartId - UUID of the parent shopping cart
 * @param props.cartItemId - UUID of the cart item to be deleted
 * @returns Void
 * @throws {Error} When the cart is not found
 * @throws {Error} When the cart is not owned by the customer
 * @throws {Error} When the cart item is not found
 * @throws {Error} When the cart item does not belong to the specified cart
