 * provided seller_id matches the authenticated session. All products are
 * assigned a unique UUID, timestamps in ISO-8601 format, and persisted to the
 * normalized product catalog. Failure modes include authorization error if
 * seller_id does not match authenticated account, or referential integrity
 * violation if foreign keys do not exist. Returns the complete product entity
 * after creation.
 *
 * @param props - Request properties
 * @param props.seller - The authenticated seller creating the product
 * @param props.body - Product creation fields (category, title, status, etc.)
 * @returns Fully populated product entity as persisted in the catalog
 * @throws {Error} When attempting to create a product for another seller
