 * owner only).
 *
 * Retrieves all metadata fields for a shopping cart owned by the authenticated
 * customer. This includes the cart's unique UUID, owner (customer/user),
 * session token (if guest cart), creation and update timestamps, and the total
 * count of items present in the cart. Enforces strict ownership—customers can
 * only access their own cart records. Throws an error if the cart does not
 * exist, is not owned by the user, or if any validation fails. All date and
 * UUID values are returned as strings with proper branding for API contract
 * compliance.
 *
 * @param props - Request properties
 * @param props.customer - Authenticated customer making the request
 * @param props.cartId - The unique cart UUID (primary key) to retrieve
 * @returns All cart metadata for the given cart ID, with current cart item
 *   count
 * @throws {Error} When the cart does not exist or is not owned by the
