 * Fetches shipment detail (carrier, tracking number, status, timestamps) for a
 * specific customer order shipment, enforcing strict ownership and access
 * control. Only the customer who owns the order can access shipment details.
 *
 * @param props - Request properties
 * @param props.customer - The authenticated customer
 * @param props.orderId - Unique identifier of the parent order record
 * @param props.shipmentId - Unique identifier of the shipment record
 * @returns The full shipment record, with date fields as ISO8601 strings
