 * authorization is strictly enforced. Core review association is immutable.
 * Audit functionality is assumed to be handled outside this function.
 *
 * @param props - Properties required for the update
 * @param props.customer - Authenticated customer payload
 * @param props.reviewId - UUID of the review context
 * @param props.attachmentId - UUID of the attachment to update
 * @param props.body - Record with updatable attachment fields (file_uri,
 *   file_type, file_size)
 * @returns The updated attachment metadata, or throws error for not
 *   found/forbidden
 * @throws {Error} When the attachment does not exist
