 * attached to a specific product review, allowing updates to media URI and
 * caption fields. Only administrators can perform this update. Ensures the
 * snapshot exists, the review exists, and that the snapshot is associated with
 * the given review. If the review or snapshot does not exist, or the
 * association is invalid, throws an error (404).
 *
 * @param props - Request properties
 * @param props.administrator - The authenticated administrator performing the
 *   operation
 * @param props.reviewId - The unique identifier of the review to which the
 *   snapshot is attached
 * @param props.snapshotId - The unique identifier of the snapshot being updated
 * @param props.body - Object containing only the fields allowed to update
 *   (media_uri, caption)
 * @returns The updated snapshot entity as IAimallBackendSnapshot
 * @throws {Error} When the review, snapshot, or their association does not
 *   exist
