 * @param props.reviewId - UUID of the review associated with the comment
 * @param props.commentId - UUID of the comment to update
 * @param props.body - Fields to update: body, is_private, deleted_at
 * @returns The fully updated comment entity as per IAimallBackendComment
 * @throws {Error} When the comment does not exist or seller is not the comment
