 * 이 엔드포인트는 판매자가 자신의 상품에 대해 번들 마스터(묶음 상품) 또는 번들 구성품(다른 상품의 구성품)으로 지정된 모든 상품 번들
 * 관계를 반환합니다. 입력된 상품 ID에 대해 번들 테이블에 마스터나 구성품으로 연결된 모든 관계가 조회됩니다.
 *
 * 인증된 판매자만 자신의 상품에 대해 번들 정보를 조회할 수 있으며, 상품을 소유하지 않은 경우 403 오류, 존재하지 않는 상품인 경우
 * 404 오류가 발생합니다.
 *
 * @param props - 요청 정보 (인증된 판매자/SellerPayload, 상품 ID)
 * @param props.seller - 인증된 판매자(토큰 기반 인증)
 * @param props.productId - 번들 관계를 조회할 대상 상품의 UUID
 * @returns IPageIAimallBackendProductBundle (page 정보와 번들 관계 데이터 전체)
 * @throws {Error} 상품이 존재하지 않으면 404, 소유하지 않은 상품일 경우 403
 */
export async function get__aimall_backend_seller_products_$productId_productBundles(props: {
  seller: SellerPayload;
  productId: string & tags.Format<"uuid">;
}): Promise<IPageIAimallBackendProductBundle> {
  const { seller, productId } = props;

  // 1. 상품 소유권 및 존재 확인
  const product = await MyGlobal.prisma.aimall_backend_products.findUnique({
    where: { id: productId },
    select: { id: true, seller_id: true },
  });
  if (!product) throw new Error("Product not found");
  if (product.seller_id !== seller.id)
    throw new Error("권한이 없습니다: 해당 상품의 소유자가 아닙니다.");

  // 2. 번들 관계(마스터/구성품) 모두 조회
  const bundles = await MyGlobal.prisma.aimall_backend_product_bundles.findMany(
    {
      where: {
        OR: [
          { bundle_product_id: productId },
          { component_product_id: productId },
        ],
      },
      select: {
        id: true,
        bundle_product_id: true,
        component_product_id: true,
        is_required: true,
        quantity: true,
      },
    },
  );

  // 3. 결과 반환 (DTO 타입 반환)
  return {
    pagination: {
      current: 1,
      limit: bundles.length,
      records: bundles.length,
      pages: 1,
    },
    data: bundles.map((b) => ({
      id: b.id,
      bundle_product_id: b.bundle_product_id,
      component_product_id: b.component_product_id,
      is_required: b.is_required,
      quantity: b.quantity,
    })),
  };
}

import { MyGlobal } from "../MyGlobal";
import typia, { tags } from "typia";
import { Prisma } from "@prisma/client";
import { v4 } from "uuid";
import { toISOStringSafe } from "../util/toISOStringSafe";
import { IAimallBackendComment } from "@ORGANIZATION/PROJECT-api/lib/structures/IAimallBackendComment";
import { IPageIAimallBackendComment } from "@ORGANIZATION/PROJECT-api/lib/structures/IPageIAimallBackendComment";
import { IPage } from "@ORGANIZATION/PROJECT-api/lib/structures/IPage";
import { CustomerPayload } from "../decorators/payload/CustomerPayload";

/**
 * Search and paginate comments for a specific review (customer-side,
 * privacy-safe).
 *
 * Only returns comments that are either public (is_private=false) or written by
 * the calling customer. Supports filtering on parent_id, customer_id,
 * is_private, and created_at range. Pagination and sorting (by created_at desc)
 * are supported. Throws if reviewId is not found.
 *
 * @param props - Request properties
 * @param props.customer - The authenticated customer (CustomerPayload)
 * @param props.reviewId - The reviewed product's UUID
 * @param props.body - Search and pagination filter structure
 *   (IAimallBackendComment.IRequest)
 * @returns Paginated result set of review comments visible to the customer
 * @throws {Error} When the reviewId does not exist
 */
export async function patch__aimall_backend_customer_reviews_$reviewId_comments(props: {
  customer: CustomerPayload;
  reviewId: string & tags.Format<"uuid">;
  body: IAimallBackendComment.IRequest;
}): Promise<IPageIAimallBackendComment> {
  const { customer, reviewId, body } = props;

  // 1. Verify the review exists
  const review = await MyGlobal.prisma.aimall_backend_reviews.findUnique({
    where: { id: reviewId },
  });
  if (!review) throw new Error("reviewId not found");

  // 2. Prepare pagination params (defaults: page=1, limit=20)
  const page = body.page != null && body.page > 0 ? body.page : 1;
  const limit = body.limit != null && body.limit > 0 ? body.limit : 20;
  const skip = (page - 1) * limit;

  // 3. Build where clause for filtering comments
  const where = {
    review_id: reviewId,
    deleted_at: null,
    ...(body.parent_id !== undefined &&
      body.parent_id !== null && {
        parent_id: body.parent_id,
      }),
    ...(body.customer_id !== undefined &&
      body.customer_id !== null && {
        customer_id: body.customer_id,
      }),
    ...(body.is_private !== undefined &&
      body.is_private !== null && {
        is_private: body.is_private,
      }),
    ...(body.created_at_from != null || body.created_at_to != null
      ? {
          created_at: {
            ...(body.created_at_from != null && {
              gte: body.created_at_from,
            }),
            ...(body.created_at_to != null && {
              lte: body.created_at_to,
            }),
          },
        }
      : {}),
    // Privacy rule: only public or owned-by-customer comments
    OR: [{ is_private: false }, { customer_id: customer.id }],
  };

  // 4. Query matching comments and count
  const [rows, total] = await Promise.all([
    MyGlobal.prisma.aimall_backend_comments.findMany({
      where,
      orderBy: { created_at: "desc" },
      skip,
      take: limit,
    }),
    MyGlobal.prisma.aimall_backend_comments.count({ where }),
  ]);

  // 5. Map rows to API DTO, converting Date fields properly
  const data = rows.map((row) => ({
    id: row.id,
    post_id: row.post_id ?? null,
    review_id: row.review_id ?? null,
    parent_id: row.parent_id ?? null,
    customer_id: row.customer_id ?? null,
    body: row.body,
    is_private: row.is_private,
    created_at: toISOStringSafe(row.created_at),
    updated_at: toISOStringSafe(row.updated_at),
    deleted_at: row.deleted_at ? toISOStringSafe(row.deleted_at) : null,
  }));

  return {
    pagination: {
      current: page,
      limit,
      records: total,
      pages: Math.ceil(total / limit),
    },
    data,
  };
}

import { MyGlobal } from "../MyGlobal";
import typia, { tags } from "typia";
import { Prisma } from "@prisma/client";
