 *   customer/address, and update fields)
 * @param props.administrator - Authenticated administrator performing the
 *   update
 * @param props.customerId - UUID of the customer whose address is being updated
 * @param props.addressId - UUID of the address to update (must belong to
 *   customerId)
 * @param props.body - Fields for updating the address record per
 *   IAimallBackendAddress.IUpdate
 * @returns The updated address record (all fields) after modification
 * @throws {Error} If the address is not found or does not belong to the
 *   customer
