 * for audit and potential restoration. Only accessible to administrators.
 * Throws if not found or already deleted.
 *
 * @param props - Request properties
 * @param props.administrator - The authenticated administrator payload
 *   (authorization/identity)
 * @param props.postId - The UUID of the post to soft delete
